SUMMARY:Mocktails & Masterpieces at Pullen Park
DESCRIPTION:Join us for this adult-only (18+) evening of fun and creativity at Pullen Park!\nEach ticket includes one signature mocktail\, a ride on the carousel\, and the opportunity to make four different hands-on art projects at your leisure. Whether you’re a seasoned crafter or just looking for a relaxing night out\, this “paint and sip” offers a creative evening in a unique and historic setting. \nCome in an artistic mood and leave with four different masterpieces of your own. It’s a perfect evening to unleash creative energy\, socialize\, and a rare opportunity to enjoy Pullen Park after hours. \nYour ticket unlocks a full experience: one signature mocktail and the chance to make four unique\, hands-on art projects at your own pace. Whether you’re a seasoned maker or just looking for a relaxed night out\, each craft station offers something fun\, beautiful\, or delightfully memorable.
URL:https://unitedarts.org/calendar/mocktails-masterpieces-at-pullen-park/
LOCATION:Pullen Park\, 520 Ashe Ave\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27606\, Raleigh\, NC\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://unitedarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/advertising-photo-2-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Raleigh Parks%2C Recreation and Cultural Resources":MAILTO:savannah.hubbard@raleighnc.gov
END:VEVENT
